    <!-- Privacy policy (shown in-app) -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Workshop Manual Organiser stores all manuals, pages, notes and VINs locally on your device. Nothing is uploaded.\n\nThe app uses the system camera/document pickers and Internet only for the configured local LLM connection. It does not request legacy storage permissions. There are no analytics, advertising or tracking SDKs in this app.\n\nUninstalling the app, or using Delete on a manual, removes the associated data. Cloud backup is disabled for user documents by the app’s backup rules.</string>

